+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 With merge_others and more languages than langs_count, the card shows langs_count - 1 languages and Others (tests/renderTopLanguages.test.js) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 With merge_others and no more languages than langs_count, the card shows every language and no Others (tests/renderTopLanguages.test.js) [AC-2]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 useLanguages merges the languages past langs_count - 1 into Others when merge_others is set (src/cards/top-languages-card.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 Add merge_others to the top languages options type and the readme (src/cards/types.d.ts, readme.md)
